FLOOR:  up 1
MOOD:   The bell tower. The bell rope is long gone; a square hole in the floor looks down on the altar.
THING:  H = hole in the floor do:hole
THING:  B = stone block do:block
THING:  R = lever do:lever
EVENT:  when=bump at=R then=reset again=yes
